+  - 'L7 progress round 5, TOOLING FAILURE (2026-07-12, claude-fable-5, first
+    fable-5 leg of the campaign): confirmed the 358-action prefix replays
+    cleanly to level 6, but immediately after that this session''s own
+    frame-only diagnostic printer crashed -- it assumed a single 64x64
